recommend keep-going the Purse r1 crux stands (verdict · conservation · arrival-independent · refuse whole); next r2 (the verdict travels as a format purse-v1 Bron record) mirrors till_bron, then r3 across a Knot, r4 a real fixture true. Per-account mint authority · a served Purse · breach renames (cairn-first) · deep debride · seed force-push stay Keaton's hand.
